&lt;/div>
&lt;div class="sect1">
&lt;h2 id="_introduction_into_c_part_2">Introduction into C++ (Part 2)&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="sectionbody">
&lt;div class="paragraph">
&lt;p>In this next example / tutorial we will have a look at sound producing program (aka a synth), for which we utilize the SDL library
(Simple direct media library). We will go about the program, line for line and explain the different items.&lt;/p>
&lt;/div>
&lt;div class="paragraph">
&lt;p>Lets begin…​&lt;/p>
&lt;/div>
&lt;div class="paragraph">
&lt;p>First of all we have the includes for the SDL library, we will have a look at the header file later. Also we include cmath for math and iostream
for in- and output (but in this example only output).&lt;/p>
&lt;/div></description></item></channel></rss>